		<!-- Text -->
		
		<Language>
			<Text id="core.descLore">
				The Voskhod III is the pre-syrtis war ancestor to the Antares III.
				Unlike its two smaller siblings, the Voskhod III was designed later
				in order to address the growing need for even more capacity for
				moving basic supplies and raw materials for the ongoing colonization
				boom.

				The already weak modular structure was further strained by the addition
				of another cargo module, so the Voskhod III features additional supports
				braced on the engine nacelles that help support and stabilize the fore
				cargo module.
			</Text>
			<Text id="core.desc">
				The Voskhod III is a very slow and ponderous superfreighter, even by
				superfreighter standards.
